{
  "id": "assets",
  "name": "资产层",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "kind": "builtin",
  "minKernel": "0.1.0",
  "kernelApi": "^1",
  "icon": "archive",
  "description": "可沉淀的经验（contracts/asset.schema.json 的落地）：note/skill/checklist/decision/procedure；append-only + 显式 supersede（旧条标 superseded 并反向指 superseded_by）；provenance 必填；可单条硬删。任务一键沉淀 = POST /assets {type:\"note\", provenance:{inputs:[task_id]}}。",
